window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v27-036-768533b998d02360.json"]={sha256:"768533b998d023602a24aa77aefc80b33b3ec253ad1a98a804369b3a9b1d9dda",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-480785fc58a242f3","url":"https://github.com/secure-systems-lab/dsse/blob/master/protocol.md","title":"DSSE protocol v1.0.2","titleEn":"DSSE protocol v1.0.2","publisher":"Secure Systems Lab / DSSE","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-036","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v27-036","related":[{"id":"security-v27-037","referenceUrls":["https://spdx.github.io/spdx-spec/v3.0.1/model/Core/Classes/ExternalMap/","https://spdx.github.io/spdx-spec/v3.0.1/model/Core/Classes/IntegrityMethod/"],"title":"SPDX 3.0.1：外部元素映射與完整性解析","titleEn":"SPDX 3.0.1: external element maps and integrity resolution","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：28與31位元組由實際編碼重建，型別大小寫及字元數負例不能通過相同簽章契約。 交付dsse-pae.txt、UTF-8十六進位表及錯字元數負例；測試不含任何真實私鑰。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reconstruct 28 and 31 bytes from actual encoding and reject type-case and character-count counterexamples under the original signing contract. Deliver dsse-pae.txt, the UTF-8 hexadecimal table and character-count counterexample. The exercise contains no real signing secrets and can reproduce the byte-level contract offline.","difference":"建立10個外部元素映射，列externalSpdxId、locationHint、definingArtifact及verifiedUsing；本地以兩個不同內容但相同檔名的文件測試關聯。","differenceEn":"Build ten external maps with externalSpdxId, locationHint, definingArtifact and verifiedUsing. Use two local documents with the same filename but different contents to test whether resolution binds the correct element rather than merely locating a file.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["PAE以DSSEv1、兩個十進位長度及空格界定欄位；長度是位元組數，payloadType本身也受簽章保護。keyid僅為提示，不能獨立決定信任。 text/plain為10位元組，A量B為5位元組；PAE前綴6位元組、四個分隔空格4位元組，長度字串分別為2與1位元組。 PAE總長6+4+2+10+1+5=28位元組；內容改A量子B為8位元組時總長31。","本課消費政策要求解析到正確元素且完整性符合；規格可選欄位不等於本地安全需求可省略。計數只納入雙條件同時成立者。 10個映射中8個能解析，當中6個完整性可驗證；另外2個無法解析與2個完整性不足分開記錄。 完整可用率6/10×100=60%；補齊一個已解析映射的正確完整性證據後為7/10×100=70%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["PAE separates DSSEv1, decimal lengths and fields with spaces. Lengths count bytes and the payload type is authenticated. A keyid hint does not independently establish trust, so the verifier still selects an authorized key through its own policy. text/plain has ten bytes and A量B has five UTF-8 bytes. Count six bytes for the prefix, four separating spaces and two and one bytes for the decimal length strings respectively; retain the exact payload encoding. Total PAE length is 6+4+2+10+1+5=28 bytes. Replacing the payload with A量子B gives eight payload bytes and total length 31, while the one-digit payload-length field remains one byte.","The selected consumer policy requires resolution to the intended element and acceptable integrity evidence. A field optional in the interchange format may still be required by this local policy; count only records satisfying both conditions. Eight of ten maps resolve, and six of those have verifiable integrity evidence. Keep two unresolved and two integrity-incomplete cases separate, preserving both the retrieval result and the identity it actually returned. Fully usable coverage is 6/10×100=60 percent. Supplying correct integrity evidence for one already resolved map gives 7/10×100=70 percent, without pretending that unresolved mappings have become available.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v27-046","referenceUrls":["https://docs.sigstore.dev/policy-controller/overview/"],"title":"Sigstore Policy Controller：跨政策AND與權威OR語意","titleEn":"Sigstore Policy Controller: policy AND and authority OR semantics","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：28與31位元組由實際編碼重建，型別大小寫及字元數負例不能通過相同簽章契約。 交付dsse-pae.txt、UTF-8十六進位表及錯字元數負例；測試不含任何真實私鑰。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Reconstruct 28 and 31 bytes from actual encoding and reject type-case and character-count counterexamples under the original signing contract. Deliver dsse-pae.txt, the UTF-8 hexadecimal table and character-count counterexample. The exercise contains no real signing secrets and can reproduce the byte-level contract offline.","difference":"建立16個映像描述與兩個皆匹配的ClusterImagePolicy，每個政策列權威結果；固定namespace在執行範圍內，未匹配政策採本地deny。","differenceEn":"Build 16 image descriptors and two matching ClusterImagePolicy objects, recording authority outcomes inside each. Keep the namespace within enforcement scope and explicitly select deny for unmatched images so scope exclusions do not masquerade as policy success.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["PAE以DSSEv1、兩個十進位長度及空格界定欄位；長度是位元組數，payloadType本身也受簽章保護。keyid僅為提示，不能獨立決定信任。 text/plain為10位元組，A量B為5位元組；PAE前綴6位元組、四個分隔空格4位元組，長度字串分別為2與1位元組。 PAE總長6+4+2+10+1+5=28位元組；內容改A量子B為8位元組時總長31。","本課每個匹配政策至少一個authority通過，且所有匹配政策都通過才准入；總通過數必須由逐映像交集取得。沒有policy匹配的情況另依no-match-policy處理。 16個映像中政策A通過12個，政策B通過10個，兩者共同通過8個；每個共同通過者都至少有一個各政策認可權威。 完整准入8/16×100=50%；補正兩個A已通過者的B證據後，交集10，比例62.5%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["PAE separates DSSEv1, decimal lengths and fields with spaces. Lengths count bytes and the payload type is authenticated. A keyid hint does not independently establish trust, so the verifier still selects an authorized key through its own policy. text/plain has ten bytes and A量B has five UTF-8 bytes. Count six bytes for the prefix, four separating spaces and two and one bytes for the decimal length strings respectively; retain the exact payload encoding. Total PAE length is 6+4+2+10+1+5=28 bytes. Replacing the payload with A量子B gives eight payload bytes and total length 31, while the one-digit payload-length field remains one byte.","At least one authority must pass inside each matching policy, and all matching policies must pass for admission. Derive counts from image-level intersections; the no-policy-match case is governed separately by no-match-policy, not by a vacuous mathematical AND. Policy A passes 12 of 16 images and B passes ten, with eight passing both. Each joint-positive image has at least one accepted authority in each policy; marginal counts alone do not establish the intersection. Admission is 8/16×100=50 percent. Repairing B evidence for two already A-positive images grows the intersection to ten, giving 62.5 percent while preserving the authority logic.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-b9b88decb90666bd","url":"https://spdx.github.io/spdx-spec/v3.0.1/model/Core/Classes/ExternalMap/","title":"SPDX 3.0.1 ExternalMap","titleEn":"SPDX 3.0.1 ExternalMap","publisher":"SPDX","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-51968045e3dcb2af","url":"https://spdx.github.io/spdx-spec/v3.0.1/model/Core/Classes/IntegrityMethod/","title":"SPDX 3.0.1 IntegrityMethod","titleEn":"SPDX 3.0.1 IntegrityMethod","publisher":"SPDX","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-6d4efb49dda8dcab","url":"https://docs.sigstore.dev/policy-controller/overview/","title":"Sigstore Kubernetes Policy Controller","titleEn":"Sigstore Kubernetes Policy Controller","publisher":"Sigstore","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
